msgid ""
"**Flashing red and blue**: Initializing gyroscopes. Hold the vehicle still "
"and level while it initializes the sensors."
msgstr "**红蓝交替闪烁**：初始化陀螺仪。初始化传感器时请保持飞行器静止水平。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leds-pixhawk.rst:165
#: 31ab95aa0fd14da5928a7bfb95e4a18c 822b77bb2f00482c8960a2bb27e8bb5a
#: 8763cc79771b4f648bee94800dfcd2bd be0181556d3c43da884ea9b936a777b4
#: c7813934717140bab242f28b9ac8b95f cfd3f0ff0b8c40c2a8589dfb1765361e
msgid ""
"**Flashing blue**: Disarmed, no GPS lock found. Autopilot, loiter and "
"return-to-launch modes require GPS lock."
msgstr "**蓝色闪烁**：已上锁，无 GPS 锁定。飞控、Loiter 和返航模式需要 GPS 锁定。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leds-pixhawk.rst:168
#: 16a9ffade1ec4857b852d4d0bc8caf16 5875b78a22af4d5b88c606e12015b98a
#: 72c487db52d64676837d1bc5356042de 89ae4207e19f4238b1939ac43d293ed0
#: 94f03f2151f14ce8b9a8704a7aac420b be5b19f8e3e54aefafb1dcb586424ee0
msgid "**Solid blue**: Armed with no GPS lock"
msgstr "**蓝色常亮**：已解锁，无 GPS 锁定"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leds-pixhawk.rst:170
#: 4268c826be044b48b4d506470b2f250e 54d7d5c9b60c472785cb8e7de4948b86
#: 83d13c0da50048c8a23f232abdfc6964 c02d19b70acf422796ef131049ce53da
#: ebdddae507aa49ef85f1f1d680cd94a0 f8e834f76c61426990aa0e1ff374dbfb
msgid ""
"**Flashing green**: Disarmed (ready to arm), GPS lock acquired. Quick double"
" tone when disarming from the armed state."
msgstr "**绿色闪烁**：已上锁（准备解锁），已获得 GPS 锁定。从已解锁状态上锁时会有快速双音提示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leds-pixhawk.rst:173
#: 48d82f7a36cb4fb4a5776c151fa47e53 5adb5da280f64bf187d49882a29428dd
#: 739b4018baba4fc78a099cc16fcc07ae 7634ef99f69f48bea9b1e4837ba5277a
#: 86f33e0c71794982aa4d0e3dd9777eb6 e94e6624160c422cab7fc30ca68209f2
msgid ""
"**Fast Flashing green**: Same as above but GPS is using SBAS (so should have"
" better position estimate)."
msgstr "**绿色快速闪烁**：同上，但 GPS 使用 SBAS（因此应有更好的位置估计）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leds-pixhawk.rst:176
#: 3e2795d7c00847b5891c61875b318be1 44699ac2eded40d69852c7aaf065c1b6
#: 4d43419569e340fcb78c480a969f43d3 7494b40399b44a43b2ddbaf1080ccc9d
#: 8d0854e125034a229f6702f3b9651048 c626c4eda64d44329e85a89756e2ba84
msgid ""
"**Solid green - with single long tone at time of arming:** Armed, GPS lock "
"acquired. Ready to fly!"
msgstr "**绿色常亮——解锁时伴随一声长音：** 已解锁，已获得 GPS 锁定。可以飞行！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leds-pixhawk.rst:179
#: 1a2479277e87412fbbd55cba503e19c6 8614d616c1c24e6ba2e4c923c3983306
#: 8c979c4e9187427ca784b87c2a438299 f52b9f03ef7a4b489302489bcde9ec14
#: f65ac37417144d379103a36a50b8ba73 fb679da334f44c1cb84ac25158f74aa0
msgid ""
"**Double flashing yellow:** Failing pre-arm checks (system refuses to arm)."
msgstr "**双闪黄色：** 解锁前检查失败（系统拒绝解锁）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-leds-pixhawk.rst:182
#: 7acbf6b49d03492cacb4684c7597db43 7f1a8954c3d245079b8a37e2dd90f9c9
#: 8b7bd31d4c0d44e7adfbe29f6b47eff1 a5f75f6a64cc4ca6a3ab2e9b1e85d1af
